WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.773
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind algorithms as everyday

00:00:05.773 --> 00:00:06.280
instructions.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:12.183
Algorithm: is an ordered set of steps to solve a task. Sequence: puts instructions in

00:00:12.183 --> 00:00:13.197
the right order.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:18.973
Repeat: does an instruction again. Condition: chooses an action based on a test.

00:00:18.973 --> 00:00:22.012
Debugging: looks for and fixes errors in instructions.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:27.633
Design a simple paper model explaining algorithm, sequence and repeat. Trade models

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:31.208
with a classmate and explain how your design works.
